      ],
      "source": "https://www.sa-venues.com/attractionswc/zonnebloem.php",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Today, Zonnebloem hosts the Cape Peninsula University of Technology and a few police housing units.",
